# 旧版集中示例保留。当前完整验证请使用各 Demo 下的 README.md 和 requests.http。

### XA 成功（每次更换业务号，IDE HTTP Client 支持 {{$uuid}}）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"xa-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"NONE"}

### XA：扣款后抛异常，观察两库同时回滚
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"xa-fail-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"AFTER_ACCOUNT"}

### XA 两库状态
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/xa/state

### Outbox：模拟扣款已提交但 ACK 丢失，然后调用下一条下单
POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/demo/faults?loseAckNext=1

### Outbox 下单，最初返回 PENDING
POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/outbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"outbox-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 查看次数、错误和 DONE/DEAD 状态
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/outbox/tasks

### 最终订单、余额和库存
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/outbox/state

### Seata AT 成功，全局事务跨三个独立服务
POST http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/at/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"at-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"NONE"}

### Seata AT：所有分支已本地提交后，故意触发全局回滚
POST http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/at/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"at-fail-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"AFTER_ACCOUNT"}

### AT 两库状态
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/at/state

### 通知：先失败两次，再丢一次 ACK
POST http://127.0.0.1:8086/demo/faults?failNext=2&loseAckNext=1

### 本地记录支付事实和待通知任务
POST http://127.0.0.1:8086/api/notify/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"notify-{{$uuid}}","userId":"U1001","productId":"SKU-001","quantity":2,"unitPrice":10.50,"failAt":"NONE"}

### 查看通知重试状态
GET http://127.0.0.1:8086/api/notify/tasks
